  "fields": {
    "responsibility": "One complete RC-domain primary/span mutator and borrower source contract, composed with accepted live-source construction, RootTask freeze/census/scan and physical C exit owners.",
    "retired": "Duplicated SFUN payload policy/direct mutator store and partial RC borrower owner check. Existing public void setter, fallible setter, source mutex, primary/span identity rules, official names and module layout remain. VM table/object retirement is blocked and uncommitted.",
    "validation": "Same-cache C23 native rebuild,51 generated inputs reused, no generation. Real owner/frozen/shared-borrow refusal;12 SFUN histories192 actions, processor1 and replay/shrink; six RC stateful histories714 actions/1440 draws; frame, multi-shot, generator and layout consumers. Exact previous module and public SFUN callback binary reuse, older ABI refusal.13 existing root QNT tests; unchanged entry QNT and Lean arithmetic reused.39 selected framework tests pass. Original408 cases392 pass16 fail86.453s; no new observed failing names versus exact baseline whole/prefix. Original default GSC RC compilation SIG11 under both baseline/current images retained; separate p1 compilation and same p2 runtime fixture pass.",
    "benefits": "One source gate decides actual owner, OPEN/not joined, bound and borrowed identity before stores under the existing mutex; no new root permits, allocation or metadata. This creates one native RC-root barrier seam without duplicating lifecycle/GC authorities. Stable ABI admits actual old consumers.",
    "costs": "All measured layouts unchanged: RC56, activation40, context320, VM80056, GSTATE87088 bytes. A common call/index/borrow branch adds work;0/1/8 body medians regress2.065%,1.217%,2.680%. No proven throughput, peak or whole-workflow benefit. Conditional net gain is correctness and one maintained source policy, with explicit measured latency liability.",
    "process": "One complete five-path source authority; failed combined layout proposal and six rejected unintegrated prototypes have separate evidence/dispositions. Do not equate source path cleanup to independent SMP progress or widen this unit into layout/GC/scheduler redesign.",
    "checklist": "dev/refactoring/modern-c/root-write.org#root-write-authority",
    "models": "Strict OpenSysML SDK: nine obligations, three actual source refinement maps; existing ASCENT current/missing/stale observations. Existing QNT owns interleavings and13 root-store tests; unchanged Lean owns size/address arithmetic only. C provenance, locking and cooperative stop are conditional source refinement, not a C weak-memory theorem.",
    "open": "Original GSI/GSC failures remain. Combined retirement division failure is unattributed and blocks that separate responsibility. General foreign-thread admission, asynchronous owner-death recovery and whole Gerbil acceptance remain separate. Foundation4/4 historical; independent SMP1/12 with11 open unchanged."
  },
